  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat4/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. fdd99a9eae (INV-vokut, 2026-09-28) fixed the fully qualified form: `scala.sys.process.Process(c).!` now emits scala:scala.sys.process.Process:0-0:Process and classifies subprocess (plus a deliberate simultaneous fs_write row). `sys.process.Process(\"git ...\").!!` still emits scala:external:0-0:Process with call_construct=method and reaches no boundary. Only the sys-rooted half remains. MECHANISM: inline path taken as module only when its root is scala/java/javax, so a path rooted at an auto-imported package is dropped. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-tuzaf."  # 8380
